      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a monologue for a late-night style roast segment. The theme is \"Cultural Clash.\" I need some sharp, observational jokes about the differences between how Italian-Americans and Jewish-Americans handle family dinners and loud gatherings. Can you give me five solid jokes that poke fun at those specific cultural vibes?",
